shape: sequence_diagram
w: "TrackingWorker"
p: "PostProcessor"
l: "Link solver"
g: "GSI filler"
w -> p: process(frame map, total frames, vectors)
p -> p: keep observations, split tracklets
p -> l: A ends at 10, B starts at 14
l -> p: accept link (cost low, not ambiguous)
p -> g: fill frames 11 to 13
g -> p: 3 boxes, detection_backed = False
p -> p: rename B to A's ID and colour
p -> p: add bounded coast tails
p -> w: final frame map
